# BenchmarkDotNet writes its raw logs and per-run reports here. The deliverable is
# RFID_Throughput_Benchmark.md, which is written by hand from them.
BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/

# The shopper token signing key, generated on first run where none is configured, and the database
# backups. Both are per-host state that lives inside the application folder because that is the one
# place an IIS pool identity can reliably write. Committing either would publish a credential or a
# copy of the shop's data.
App_Data/
